<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Active Unlock | Celulares, Reparaciones y Pantallas</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Active Unlock - Pantallas, reparaciones, liberación de fábrica, eSIM y RSIM.">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
body {
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  background: #080808;
  color: #fff;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  background: rgba(8,8,8,.96);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
  padding: 15px 20px;
}
.nav {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}
.logo {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.logo span {
  color: #e60000;
}
nav a {
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 18px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
nav a:hover {
  color: #e60000;
}
.hero {
  min-height: 80vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 60px 20px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at center, #351010 0%, #100606 35%, #080808 70%);
}
.hero-content {
  max-width: 800px;
}
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid #e60000;
  color: #ff3333;
  padding: 7px 15px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
h1 {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 9vw, 78px);
  line-height: 1;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
h1 span {
  color: #e60000;
}
.hero p {
  color: #ccc;
  font-size: 18px;
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: 0 auto 30px;
}
.buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 14px 23px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: .2s;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: #e60000;
  color: white;
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: #ff2222;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.btn-secondary {
  border: 1px solid #444;
  color: white;
  background: #151515;
}
section {
  padding: 70px 20px;
}
.container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
}
.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.section-title h2 {
  font-size: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.section-title p {
  color: #999;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}
.card {
  background: #121212;
  border: 1px solid #292929;
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 25px;
  transition: .2s;
}
.card:hover {
  border-color: #e60000;
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}
.icon {
  font-size: 34px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}
.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 20px;
}
.card p {
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.brands {
  margin-top: 30px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}
.brand {
  padding: 10px 16px;
  background: #181818;
  border: 1px solid #333;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.contact {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #180707, #090909);
}
.contact-box {
  background: #111;
  border: 1px solid #333;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 30px;
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
}
.contact-item {
  margin: 15px 0;
  color: #ccc;
}
.contact-item strong {
  color: white;
}
footer {
  border-top: 1px solid #252525;
  padding: 25px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #777;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.whatsapp {
  position: fixed;
  right: 18px;
  bottom: 18px;
  z-index: 999;
  width: 58px;
  height: 58px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #25D366;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  nav {
    display: none;
  }
  .hero {
    min-height: 75vh;
  }
  section {
    padding: 55px 16px;
  }
  .section-title h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
  }
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="logo">ACTIVE <span>UNLOCK</span></div>
<nav>
  <a href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
  <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
  <a href="#marcas">Marcas</a>
  <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
</nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="inicio">
  <div class="hero-content">
<div class="badge">TECNOLOGÍA • REPARACIÓN • DESBLOQUEO</div>
<h1>
  ACTIVE <span>UNLOCK</span>
</h1>
<p>
  Soluciones para celulares, pantallas, reparaciones,
  liberación de fábrica, eSIM y RSIM.
</p>
<div class="buttons">
  <a class="btn btn-primary"
     href="https://wa.me/5355323969"
     target="_blank">
    💬 WhatsApp
  </a>
  <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#servicios">
    Ver servicios
  </a>
</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="servicios">
  <div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
  <h2>Nuestros servicios</h2>
  <p>Soluciones profesionales para tu dispositivo</p>
</div>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📱</div>
    <h3>Pantallas</h3>
    <p>
      Venta de pantallas con instalación o solamente
      el repuesto para técnicos y clientes.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔧</div>
    <h3>Reparaciones</h3>
    <p>
      Servicio técnico para diferentes modelos
      de celulares.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔓</div>
    <h3>Liberación</h3>
    <p>
      Servicios de liberación de fábrica y
      soluciones de red.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📶</div>
    <h3>eSIM / RSIM</h3>
    <p>
      Configuración y soluciones eSIM y RSIM
      para dispositivos compatibles.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="marcas">
  <div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
  <h2>Trabajamos con</h2>
  <p>Entre otras marcas y modelos</p>
</div>
<div class="brands">
  <div class="brand">Apple</div>
  <div class="brand">Samsung</div>
  <div class="brand">Motorola</div>
  <div class="brand">Xiaomi</div>
  <div class="brand">TECNO</div>
  <div class="brand">realme</div>
  <div class="brand">Infinix</div>
  <div class="brand">OPPO</div>
  <div class="brand">OnePlus</div>
  <div class="brand">Honor</div>
</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="contact" id="contacto">
  <div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
  <h2>Contáctanos</h2>
  <p>Estamos listos para ayudarte</p>
</div>
<div class="contact-box">
  <div class="contact-item">
    📲 <strong>WhatsApp:</strong><br>
    +53 55323969
  </div>
  <div class="contact-item">
    📍 <strong>Dirección:</strong><br>
    Calle Maceo #104 / Calle Arias y Calle Agramonte
  </div>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a class="btn btn-primary"
       href="https://wa.me/5355323969"
       target="_blank">
      Escribir por WhatsApp
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
  © 2026 Active Unlock — Todos los derechos reservados.
</footer>

☎
</body>
</html>
